& [Need]
  + Rev0.4 deliberately rejects physical commission and exposes simulation only
  + a production runner without one-use commission lease and after-lease current-state fence could replay stale authority or collide with concurrent mutation
  + P1 cannot truthfully run until a retained prepared candidate exists

& [SmallestNextStep]
  + validate exact supplied B0 and Rev0.4 upstream forms
  + close commission scope capability partition fence order ledger-before-effect and failure truth as pure data
  + emit physical-false admission evidence through a deterministic verifier

& [WhyNotBroader]
  + authentic consent signature verification durable atomic ledger platform lease process containment filesystem effects and crash recovery need a separately signed production broker
  + capacity currently fails the physical floor and Windows policy remains intact
  + Phase3A P1 writer SWA-06B provider model commit push activation and cleanup are later contracts

& [Decision]
  + pure admission is necessary bounded and directly advances enforceable hosting without manufacturing physical authority
